{
 "_note": "列表类组件共用的取数:按 scope 从页面写好的视图 `w` 里挑一个范围。零网络 —— 只读 data.*。\n⚠️ 本包的 .df 没有 request,故不需要 error 出口(G26 只管有请求的流);「没写过 w」是合法的空,不是失败。",
 "version": 1,
 "actions": [
  {
   "_note": "页面算好的整份视图(tools/todo/src/model.js buildW)。没写过 = {} → any/ok 都落 0,组件走空态。",
   "id": "w",
   "action": "data.get",
   "params": {
    "key": "w",
    "default": {}
   }
  },
  {
   "_note": "屏障:data.get 之后紧邻的一步读不到结果(晚一拍,df 章「屏障」)。",
   "op": "set",
   "props": {
    "key": "_b",
    "value": "1"
   }
  },
  {
   "op": "set",
   "props": {
    "key": "d",
    "value": "$[formatDate::(${@time.nowMs},yyyy-MM-dd)]"
   }
  },
  {
   "_note": "今天零点(设备时区)。与页面 JS 的 new Date(y,m,d) 同一个值 —— 行标签全靠它和 dm 比。",
   "op": "set",
   "props": {
    "key": "tdm",
    "value": "$[parseDate::(${d},yyyy-MM-dd)]"
   }
  },
  {
   "op": "set",
   "props": {
    "key": "base",
    "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${w.base},0)]"
   }
  },
  {
   "_note": "今天是页面保存那天之后第几天。parseNumber 0 = 截成整数串:index:: 要整数下标(Android 的 calc 返回 double)。",
   "op": "set",
   "props": {
    "key": "off",
    "value": "$[parseNumber::(round::(calc::((${tdm}-${base})/86400000)),0)]"
   }
  },
  {
   "_note": "按天摊开的格只有 14 天;超出 = 页面太久没打开,随日子变的量不可信,组件显示「数据未更新」。",
   "op": "set",
   "props": {
    "key": "ok",
    "value": "$[if::(and::(gt::(${base},0),ge::(${off},0),lt::(${off},14)),1,0)]"
   }
  },
  {
   "op": "set",
   "props": {
    "key": "any",
    "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${w.any},0)]"
   }
  },
  {
   "_note": "入参先落地:方法参数里看不见 depends 入参(methods 章 get 那一行)。",
   "op": "set",
   "props": {
    "key": "sc",
    "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${scope},all)]"
   }
  },
  {
   "_note": "「逾期」与「今天」共用同一份按日期升序的前缀,只是截的界不同。",
   "op": "set",
   "props": {
    "key": "sk",
    "value": "$[if::(eq::(${sc},over),today,${sc})]"
   }
  },
  {
   "op": "set",
   "props": {
    "key": "rows",
    "value": "$[get::(${w.s},${sk})]"
   }
  },
  {
   "_note": "行的日期上界:今天 = 今天零点(含逾期)/ 逾期 = 今天零点之前 / 其它范围不按日期截。RCN 按它逐行判,所以第二天不开页面也截得对。",
   "op": "set",
   "props": {
    "key": "lim",
    "value": "$[if::(eq::(${sc},today),${tdm},if::(eq::(${sc},over),calc::(${tdm}-1),99999999999999))]"
   }
  },
  {
   "_note": "今天 / 逾期的件数随日子变,按天查格;数据过期(ok=0)时留空 —— 行照样按 lim 截得对,只是不报总数。",
   "op": "set",
   "props": {
    "key": "n",
    "value": "$[if::(eq::(${sc},today),if::(eq::(${ok},1),index::(${w.d.rem},${off}),),if::(eq::(${sc},over),if::(eq::(${ok},1),index::(${w.d.over},${off}),),findNotEmpty::(get::(${w.sc},${sk}),0)))]"
   }
  },
  {
   "op": "set",
   "props": {
    "key": "hn",
    "value": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${n},__none__),__none__),0,1)]"
   }
  },
  {
   "op": "set",
   "props": {
    "key": "sname",
    "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(get::(${w.sn},${sk}),)]"
   }
  },
  {
   "op": "set",
   "props": {
    "key": "isLG",
    "value": "$[if::(or::(startsWith::(${sc},L),startsWith::(${sc},G)),1,0)]"
   }
  },
  {
   "op": "set",
   "props": {
    "key": "isG",
    "value": "$[if::(startsWith::(${sc},G),1,0)]"
   }
  },
  {
   "op": "set",
   "props": {
    "key": "gone",
    "value": "$[if::(and::(eq::(${isLG},1),eq::(length::(${sname}),0)),1,0)]"
   }
  },
  {
   "op": "set",
   "props": {
    "key": "rem",
    "value": "$[if::(eq::(${ok},1),findNotEmpty::(index::(${w.d.rem},${off}),0),0)]"
   }
  },
  {
   "op": "set",
   "props": {
    "key": "doneT",
    "value": "$[if::(eq::(${ok},1),findNotEmpty::(index::(${w.d.doneT},${off}),0),0)]"
   }
  },
  {
   "op": "set",
   "props": {
    "key": "ovr",
    "value": "$[if::(eq::(${ok},1),findNotEmpty::(index::(${w.d.over},${off}),0),0)]"
   }
  },
  {
   "op": "set",
   "props": {
    "key": "tot",
    "value": "$[calc::(${rem}+${doneT})]"
   }
  },
  {
   "op": "set",
   "props": {
    "key": "sweep",
    "value": "$[if::(gt::(${tot},0),round::(calc::(${doneT}*360/${tot})),0)]"
   }
  },
  {
   "op": "set",
   "props": {
    "key": "ic",
    "value": "${w.ic}"
   }
  },
  {
   "action": "resultFilter",
   "params": {
    "keys": [
     "rows",
     "tdm",
     "lim",
     "n",
     "hn",
     "sc",
     "sname",
     "isLG",
     "isG",
     "gone",
     "any",
     "ok",
     "rem",
     "doneT",
     "ovr",
     "tot",
     "sweep",
     "ic"
    ]
   }
  }
 ]
}